markdown
# 🏙️ UrbanMind AI

<div align="center">

![UrbanMind AI Banner](https://img.shields.io/badge/🏙️_UrbanMind-AI-6366f1?style=for-the-badge&logoColor=white)

**Autonomous Urban Planning System powered by Multi-Agent Simulation & Google Gemini AI**

